[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……待って。何か音がする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Wait. I hear something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か大きなものが移動してる音よ、これ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sounds like something big moving around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000いったい何が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What in the world..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What the?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人造頂獣！？\u3000どうしてここに……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A man-made Apexi?! Why is it here...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "油断しない！\u3000みんな構えて――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay alert! Everyone, get ready—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who's there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……その声は、ブラッドさん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh... Brad, is that you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナか。こんな所で何をしている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana? What are you doing in a place like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや。お久しぶりです。こんな所で奇遇ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, it's been a while. What a coincidence meeting you here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ワルターも！？\nあんたたちこそなんでここにいるのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther too?! What are YOU doing here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人造頂獣の平和利用について検証を行っている。\nここであれば人目に付かないしな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're testing the peaceful applications of man-made Apexi. This location keeps us away from prying eyes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そしてこの面子は……なるほど、騎士試験か。ここが\n試験場になるとはな。私としたことがうかつだった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And this group is... I see, the knight examination. I wasn't aware this area had been designated as a testing ground. Careless of me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "混乱させて申し訳ない。\n我々のことは気にせず試験を続けてくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I apologize for the confusion. Please continue your examination and pay us no mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。私たちは試験には、\n本当に、何も関係ありませんからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. We have absolutely, positively nothing to do with your examination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……余計なことを言うな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Don't say unnecessary things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "失礼、念をいれたつもりでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My apologies, I was merely being thorough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "？\u3000ま、まあ、それならいいけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "? W-well, if you say so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、大丈夫なのよね、これ？\n言うこと聞くの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But this thing is safe, right? It'll follow your commands?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんですとも。\nそもそも言うことを聞かせられないようでは失敗作です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But of course. If it couldn't obey commands, it would be a failed experiment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "保証しましょう。\n私の制御から外れることはないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I guarantee it. It won't deviate from my control."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふうん……ま、それができなきゃ\n王都を襲わせることだってできなかったわよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... Well, if you couldn't control it, you wouldn't have been able to attack the capital with it either, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい、こんな所で時間を潰している\n暇があるのか？\u3000さっさと試験に戻れ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, do you really have time to waste here? Get back to your examination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだった！\u3000それじゃあ、失礼しま――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh right! Well then, excuse us—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what was that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "天井の崩落だ！\u3000身を守れ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The ceiling's collapsing! Protect yourselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……収まったか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Has it stopped?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見て！\u3000あれ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look! Over there...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "帰り道が、落石で塞がってる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The way back is blocked by fallen rocks..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、どうするのよこれ。\n試験どころじゃなくない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, what are we supposed to do now? This is way beyond just an exam!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この落石をどうにかしないとな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We need to do something about these rocks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配はいりません。\nこういう時こそ、人造頂獣の出番です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to worry. This is precisely when a man-made Apexi proves its worth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、この岩を排除なさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, remove these rocks."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "人造頂獣",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man-made Apexi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたのです？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グオオオオ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "GROOOOAARRR!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "人造頂獣",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man-made Apexi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なんということでしょう。\n人造頂獣が私の制御を外れてしまいました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh dear. The man-made Apexi has broken free from my control."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元極夜の錬金党の一員。優秀な研究者であり、\nかつて人造頂獣を生み出した",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A former member of the Polar Night Alchemists. As a brilliant researcher, he was responsible for creating the man-made Apexi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター・マン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther Mann"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ王国錬金爵。錬金術士たちの監査役として\n現在は人造頂獣の平和利用について模索している",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna's Seneschal of Alchemy. Currently exploring peaceful applications for man-made Apexi as part of his role overseeing alchemists."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッドリー・カーン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bradley Khan"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]